<title>USA: Foamex to sell JPS unit for $220 mln.</title>
<headline>Foamex to sell JPS unit for $220 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LINWOOD, Pa. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foamex International Inc said on Wednesday it agreed to sell JPS Automotive LP to a subsidiary of Collins &amp; Aikman Corp for $220 million.</p>
</text>
